	(text "USB current policy: EN2=0 and 100k pull-down on EN1 start in USB100 mode. Firmware may assert USB_HIGH_CURRENT only after USB configuration to enter USB500."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.19 190 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "708c0556-dc7c-49d5-8609-89ca3b48657f")
	)
	(text "Battery requirement: use a protected 1-cell LiPo pack with dedicated 10k NTC. Missing/open NTC must inhibit charging; R21 is DNP for controlled pack variants only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.19 184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eacb6575-28cd-4de6-8be9-c06ed6205368")
	)
	(text "Thermal/power hold: design 3.3V rail for >=0.8A continuous and 1A transient. Use exposed-pad copper/vias on BQ24074 and TPS63020; validate temperature and ripple under Wi-Fi + FEM TX + charging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.19 178 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37f8c093-7cb6-4b7e-92ec-8a2b046fa06a")
	)
	(text "USB layout: place U6 and CC/VBUS protectors at J4; route D+/D- as 90-ohm differential pair. R38/R39 are source-side tuning footprints. R42 is default shield bond; C80 DNP EMC option."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.19 172 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f0279cb5-53cd-4c5a-9f0a-9fc0136c53d7")
	)
	(text "Recovery: native USB supports ROM download; J8 exposes UART0, EN and BOOT. RC reset must be validated on slow battery ramps; add a supervisor if testing shows marginal startup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.19 166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b5a8a74f-5425-4db2-92c2-8dc2a54bcf17")
	)
